# Airport map master prompt (required before any map work)

**Before writing or changing any airport map / layout / OSM import / security /
gate / curb / lounge / admin airport-editor code, you MUST:**

1. **Read** `CURSOR_PROMPT_MASTER_airport_maps_all_airports.md` at the repo root
   (full file — this is the standing spec for every airport, not just SEA).
2. **Read** `.cursor/skills/kepi-airport-bot/SKILL.md`, then `KEPI_DESIGN_LAW.md`
   (M15/M22/M26–M33), `CLAUDE.md`, and `AGENTS.md`.
3. Obey the one rule: **never claim precision Kepi hasn't earned.** Ground-truth
   where OSM tags exist; security is permanently approximate (M32); rules are
   airport-agnostic — never loosen a rule to make one airport look finished.

Standing delivery: minimal surgical changes, one design law + test per behavior,
`npm run test:laws && npm run build` before push, push to `main`.

Do not invent coordinates. Do not special-case SEA. Do not auto-publish a
re-import over a human-verified airport. M29 (routing) ≠ M33 (ground truth) —
both must pass before "verified."
